  "notable_quotes": [
    "A mixed-ligand route produced bi-functional Zn-MOF 1, [H2N(CH3)2]·Zn(NDC)(atz)·H2O, with a 3D two-fold interpenetrated framework.",
    "The framework is robust, remaining stable up to 300 °C and after 12 h immersion in solvents including DMF, methanol, and nitrobenzene.",
    "Selective CO2 adsorption is attributed to amine functionality from the N-rich ligand, consistent with amino groups promoting CO2 uptake in MOFs."
